      <div style="background: #fff; border: 1.5px solid #ACA8EA; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px; flex: 1 1 120px; min-width: 110px; font-size: 12.5px; color: #1F1976; text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;">
        <span style="display:block; font-size:10px; font-weight:600; color:#4C42CF; margin-bottom:4px; text-transform:uppercase;">Lesson 12</span>
        Two-Way Selection
